---
const features = [
  {
    icon: 'experience',
    title: 'Experiencia',
    description:
      'Con más de 20 años de experiencia, ofrecemos diagnóstico, mantenimiento y reparación automotriz con calidad y precisión.',
  },
  {
    icon: 'quality',
    title: 'Calidad',
    description:
      'Trabajamos exclusivamente con repuestos de alta calidad y certificación garantizada, seleccionados para asegurar el mejor desempeño de tu vehículo.',
  },
  {
    icon: 'service',
    title: 'Servicio',
    description:
      'Nos interesa tu seguridad y satisfacción: para nosotros no es solo un carro reparado, es un cliente seguro y completamente satisfecho.',
  },
];

const services = [
  {
    title: 'Distribución',
    image: '/servicios/distribucion.jpeg',
    alt: 'Kit original de distribución: correa, tensor, bomba de agua OEM, refrigerante y mano de obra especializada',
    description:
      'El kit de correa de distribución es uno de los mantenimientos más críticos para la protección del motor. Una correa en mal estado puede causar daños severos y reparaciones costosas, por eso realizamos el cambio completo del kit con precisión, repuestos confiables y una instalación segura que garantiza la sincronización perfecta del motor. Tu vehículo queda funcionando suave, estable y protegido para muchos kilómetros más.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Frenos y Suspensión',
    image: '/servicios/frenos-suspension.jpeg',
    alt: 'Frenos y suspensión: cambio de pastillas y discos, revisión de suspensión y amortiguadores',
    description:
      'En frenos y suspensión no se improvisa: se confía en la experiencia. Con más de 20 años cuidando la seguridad de nuestros clientes, realizamos diagnósticos precisos y mantenimientos profesionales que garantizan un frenado firme, una conducción estable y la tranquilidad que necesitas en cada viaje. Tu vida y la de tu familia dependen de un sistema de frenos y una suspensión en perfecto estado; por eso trabajamos con repuestos de calidad, técnicos expertos y procedimientos confiables que aseguran que tu vehículo responda cuando más lo necesitas.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Cambio de Aceite Completo',
    image: '/servicios/cambio-aceite.jpeg',
    alt: 'Cambio de aceite completo con aceite Motorcraft, filtros de aceite, aire del motor y aire acondicionado',
    description:
      'Tu motor merece lo mejor: haz el cambio de aceite a tiempo y dale a tu carro la potencia, protección y vida útil que necesita. ¡No esperes a que suene, cuídalo hoy!',
  },
  {
    title: 'Mantenimiento Mayor',
    image: '/servicios/mantenimiento-mayor.jpeg',
    alt: 'Mantenimiento mayor para Ford: bujías, válvula PCV, limpieza de inyectores, cables de alta y más',
    description:
      'Un motor bien afinado es sinónimo de potencia, ahorro y seguridad. Con nuestra experiencia de más de dos décadas, realizamos un mantenimiento mayor completo que optimiza el rendimiento del vehículo, mejora el consumo de combustible y prolonga la vida útil del motor. Revisamos cada componente clave con precisión técnica y utilizamos repuestos de calidad para garantizar que tu carro funcione suave, estable y con la respuesta que necesitas en cualquier camino.',
  },
];
---

<section id="servicios" class="section features">
  <div class="services-block">
    <div class="services-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="services-gradient"></div>
      <div class="services-grid"></div>
      <div class="services-glow services-glow-1"></div>
      <div class="services-glow services-glow-2"></div>
      <div class="services-glow services-glow-3"></div>
      <div class="services-decoration">
        <span class="services-shape shape-a"></span>
        <span class="services-shape shape-b"></span>
        <span class="services-shape shape-c"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container services-inner">
      <div class="services-header">
        <span class="section-label">Nuestros paquetes</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Servicios <span class="services-highlight">especializados</span></h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Mantenimiento preventivo y correctivo con repuestos de calidad y mano de obra profesional.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="services-carousel" id="services-carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Servicios especializados">
        <div class="services-visual-wrap">
          <div class="services-pulse-ring"></div>
          <div class="services-pulse-ring services-pulse-ring--delay"></div>

          <div class="services-carousel__viewport">
            <div class="services-carousel__status">
              <span class="services-status-label">Paquete activo</span>
              <span class="services-status-pulse"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="services-carousel__track" id="services-track">
              {services.map((service, i) => (
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class={`services-slide${i === 0 ? ' is-active' : ''}`}
                  data-index={i}
                  data-service-image={service.image}
                  data-service-alt={service.alt}
                  data-service-title={service.title}
                  data-service-description={service.description ?? ''}
                  aria-label={`Ver detalle de ${service.title}`}
                  aria-roledescription="slide"
                  aria-hidden={i === 0 ? 'false' : 'true'}
                >
                  <div class="services-slide__media">
                    <img
                      src={service.image}
                      alt={service.alt}
                      loading={i === 0 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'}
                      width={1200}
                      height={675}
                    />
                    <div class="services-scan-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="services-slide__info">
                    <div class="services-slide__meta">
                      <span class="services-slide__badge">
                        <span class="services-badge-dot"></span>
                        Paquete {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
                      </span>
                      <h3 class="services-slide__title">{service.title}</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="services-slide__cta">
                      Ver detalle
                      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
                      </svg>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </button>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="services-carousel__controls">
          <button type="button" class="services-nav btn-lift" id="services-prev" aria-label="Servicio anterior">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
              <path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/>
            </svg>
          </button>

          <div class="services-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Seleccionar servicio">
            {services.map((service, i) => (
              <button
                type="button"
                class={`services-dot${i === 0 ? ' is-active' : ''}`}
                data-dot={i}
                role="tab"
                aria-selected={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
                aria-label={service.title}
              ></button>
            ))}
          </div>

          <button type="button" class="services-nav btn-lift" id="services-next" aria-label="Siguiente servicio">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
              <path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="features-block">
      <div class="features-header">
        <span class="section-label reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0s">Por qué elegirnos</span>
        <h2 class="section-title reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.12s">Excelencia en cada reparación</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.22s">
          Tecnología de diagnóstico avanzada, personal calificado y un compromiso real con la seguridad de su vehículo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        {features.map((feature, i) => (
          <article class="feature-card card-lift reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${0.1 + i * 0.12}s`}>
            <div class="feature-icon" data-icon={feature.icon}>
              {feature.icon === 'experience' && (
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
                  <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
                </svg>
              )}
              {feature.icon === 'quality' && (
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
                  <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
                  <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
                </svg>
              )}
              {feature.icon === 'service' && (
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
                  <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
                  <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
                  <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
                </svg>
              )}
            </div>
            <h3 class="feature-title">{feature.title}</h3>
            <p class="feature-desc">{feature.description}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="service-modal" id="service-modal" hidden aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="service-modal__backdrop" data-close-modal></div>
    <div
      class="service-modal__dialog"
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
      aria-labelledby="service-modal-title"
      aria-describedby="service-modal-description"
    >
      <button type="button" class="service-modal__close" data-close-modal aria-label="Cerrar">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <p class="service-modal__title" id="service-modal-title"></p>
      <img class="service-modal__image" src="" alt="" />
      <div class="service-modal__description-wrap" id="service-modal-description-wrap" hidden>
        <p class="service-modal__description-label">Descripción</p>
        <p class="service-modal__description" id="service-modal-description"></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const carousel = document.getElementById('services-carousel');
  const track = document.getElementById('services-track');
  const slides = track ? Array.from(track.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.services-slide')) : [];
  const dots = carousel ? Array.from(carousel.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.services-dot')) : [];
  const prevBtn = document.getElementById('services-prev');
  const nextBtn = document.getElementById('services-next');
  const modal = document.getElementById('service-modal');
  const modalImage = modal?.querySelector('.service-modal__image') as HTMLImageElement | null;
  const modalTitle = modal?.querySelector('.service-modal__title');
  const modalDescription = modal?.querySelector('.service-modal__description');
  const modalDescriptionWrap = modal?.querySelector('#service-modal-description-wrap');

  let current = 0;
  let autoplayId: number | undefined;
  let lastFocused: HTMLElement | null = null;
  let touchStartX = 0;
  let touchDeltaX = 0;
  const AUTOPLAY_MS = 5200;

  function goTo(index: number) {
    if (!slides.length) return;
    current = (index + slides.length) % slides.length;

    slides.forEach((slide, i) => {
      const active = i === current;
      slide.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
      slide.setAttribute('aria-hidden', active ? 'false' : 'true');
    });

    dots.forEach((dot, i) => {
      const active = i === current;
      dot.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
      dot.setAttribute('aria-selected', active ? 'true' : 'false');
    });

    track?.style.setProperty('--current', String(current));
  }

  function next() {
    goTo(current + 1);
  }

  function prev() {
    goTo(current - 1);
  }

  function startAutoplay() {
    stopAutoplay();
    autoplayId = window.setInterval(next, AUTOPLAY_MS);
  }

  function stopAutoplay() {
    if (autoplayId !== undefined) {
      window.clearInterval(autoplayId);
      autoplayId = undefined;
    }
  }

  function openModal(button: HTMLButtonElement) {
    if (!modal || !modalImage || !modalTitle) return;

    const description = button.dataset.serviceDescription ?? '';
    lastFocused = button;
    modalImage.src = button.dataset.serviceImage ?? '';
    modalImage.alt = button.dataset.serviceAlt ?? '';
    modalTitle.textContent = button.dataset.serviceTitle ?? '';

    if (modalDescription && modalDescriptionWrap) {
      if (description) {
        modalDescription.textContent = description;
        modalDescriptionWrap.hidden = false;
        modal.querySelector('.service-modal__dialog')?.setAttribute('aria-describedby', 'service-modal-description');
      } else {
        modalDescription.textContent = '';
        modalDescriptionWrap.hidden = true;
        modal.querySelector('.service-modal__dialog')?.removeAttribute('aria-describedby');
      }
    }

    stopAutoplay();
    modal.hidden = false;
    modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    modal.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.service-modal__close')?.focus();
  }

  function closeModal() {
    if (!modal || !modalImage) return;

    modal.hidden = true;
    modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
    modalImage.src = '';
    if (modalDescription) modalDescription.textContent = '';
    if (modalDescriptionWrap) modalDescriptionWrap.hidden = true;
    document.body.style.overflow = '';
    lastFocused?.focus();
    lastFocused = null;
    startAutoplay();
  }

  prevBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    prev();
    startAutoplay();
  });

  nextBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    next();
    startAutoplay();
  });

  dots.forEach((dot) => {
    dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
      goTo(Number(dot.dataset.dot));
      startAutoplay();
    });
  });

  slides.forEach((slide) => {
    slide.addEventListener('click', () => openModal(slide));
  });

  carousel?.addEventListener('mouseenter', stopAutoplay);
  carousel?.addEventListener('mouseleave', startAutoplay);
  carousel?.addEventListener('focusin', stopAutoplay);
  carousel?.addEventListener('focusout', (event) => {
    if (!carousel.contains(event.relatedTarget as Node | null)) startAutoplay();
  });

  track?.addEventListener(
    'touchstart',
    (event) => {
      touchStartX = event.changedTouches[0]?.clientX ?? 0;
      touchDeltaX = 0;
      stopAutoplay();
    },
    { passive: true },
  );

  track?.addEventListener(
    'touchmove',
    (event) => {
      touchDeltaX = (event.changedTouches[0]?.clientX ?? 0) - touchStartX;
    },
    { passive: true },
  );

  track?.addEventListener(
    'touchend',
    () => {
      if (Math.abs(touchDeltaX) > 50) {
        touchDeltaX < 0 ? next() : prev();
      }
      startAutoplay();
    },
    { passive: true },
  );

  modal?.querySelectorAll('[data-close-modal]').forEach((el) => {
    el.addEventListener('click', closeModal);
  });

  document.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
    if (event.key === 'Escape' && modal && !modal.hidden) {
      closeModal();
      return;
    }

    if (!carousel || modal?.hidden === false) return;
    if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft') {
      prev();
      startAutoplay();
    }
    if (event.key === 'ArrowRight') {
      next();
      startAutoplay();
    }
  });

  goTo(0);
  startAutoplay();
</script>

<style>
  .features {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 0;
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .features::before {
    content: none;
  }

  .features-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .features-header .section-label {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .features-header .section-label::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .features-header .section-subtitle {
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition:
      opacity 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      transform 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      border-color 0.3s ease,
      background 0.3s ease,
      box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    transition-delay: var(--reveal-delay, 0s);
  }

  .feature-card.is-visible {
    transition:
      opacity 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      transform 0.3s ease,
      border-color 0.3s ease,
      background 0.3s ease,
      box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    transition-delay: 0s;
  }

  .feature-card.is-visible:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.35);
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.2);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.12) 0%, rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.05) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .services-block {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 6rem 0 5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .services-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .features-block {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 5rem;
    border-top: none;
  }

  .services-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .services-gradient {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 75% 15%, rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.16) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 15% 85%, rgba(1, 7, 56, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 45% at 50% 50%, rgba(43, 125, 233, 0.06) 0%, transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-primary) 0%, var(--bg-secondary) 45%, var(--bg-secondary) 100%);
  }

  .services-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(1, 7, 56, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(1, 7, 56, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 85% 75% at 50% 40%, black 25%, transparent 85%);
  }

  .services-glow {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(90px);
  }

  .services-glow-1 {
    width: min(520px, 55vw);
    height: min(520px, 55vw);
    top: -12%;
    right: -8%;
    background: rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.18);
  }

  .services-glow-2 {
    width: min(420px, 48vw);
    height: min(420px, 48vw);
    bottom: -8%;
    left: -6%;
    background: rgba(1, 7, 56, 0.14);
  }

  .services-glow-3 {
    width: min(360px, 40vw);
    height: min(360px, 40vw);
    top: 40%;
    left: 55%;
    background: rgba(43, 125, 233, 0.1);
  }

  .services-decoration {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .services-shape {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0.08;
    animation: servicesFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .shape-a {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    background: var(--accent);
    top: 16%;
    left: 6%;
    animation-delay: 0s;
  }

  .shape-b {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: var(--navy, #010738);
    top: 55%;
    right: 7%;
    animation-delay: 2s;
  }

  .shape-c {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    background: var(--accent);
    bottom: 14%;
    left: 3%;
    animation-delay: 4s;
  }

  @keyframes servicesFloat {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(180deg); }
  }

  .services-header {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .services-header .section-label {
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: servicesSlideInUp 0.8s ease forwards;
  }

  .services-header .section-label::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .services-header .section-title {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: servicesSlideInUp 0.8s ease 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .services-header .section-subtitle {
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: servicesFadeInUp 0.8s ease 0.35s forwards;
  }

  .services-highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent-bright) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  @keyframes servicesSlideInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes servicesFadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .services-carousel {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: servicesSlideInUp 0.8s ease 0.3s forwards;
  }

  .services-visual-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .services-pulse-ring {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 102%;
    height: 104%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(0, 52, 120, 0.28);
    border-radius: 8px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    animation: servicesPulse 3s infinite;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .services-pulse-ring--delay {
    animation-delay: 1.5s;
    border-color: rgba(43, 125, 233, 0.18);
  }

  @keyframes servicesPulse {
    0% {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.98);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    100% {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.06);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .services-carousel__viewport {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .services-carousel__status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }

  .services-status-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .services-status-pulse {
